      "body": "<!--e57a25ab6845829454e8d69fc972939a-->\n\nThe following sections might be updated with supplementary metadata relevant to reviewers and maintainers.\n\n<!--006a51241073e994b41acfe9ec718e94-->\n### External sites\n\n* Code coverage & benchmarks: https://corecheck.dev/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36442\n* Ralph review <img src=https://review.fish.foo/assets/bitcoin/bitcoin/36442.png alt=\"Ralph review status\"> https://git.fish.foo/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36442#author-ralph\n<!--021abf342d371248e50ceaed478a90ca-->\n### Reviews\nSee [the guideline](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#code-review) and [AI policy](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/doc/AI_POLICY.md) for information on the review process.\nA summary of reviews will appear here.\n<!--5faf32d7da4f0f540f40219e4f7537a3-->\n### LLM Linter (✨ experimental)\n\n\n\nPossible typos and grammar issues:\n\n- `/** Get the KeyPath of single KeyPathElements for a give multipath position */` -> `/** Get the KeyPath of single KeyPathElements for a given multipath position */` [“give” is a typo; should be “given”]\n\n\n\n\nPossible places where named args for integral literals may be used (e.g. `func(x, /*named_arg=*/0)` in C++, and `func(x, named_arg=0)` in Python):\n\n- `Parse(desc_str, keys, error, false)` in `src/wallet/test/util.cpp`\n- `Parse(desc_str, keys, error, false)` in `src/wallet/wallet.cpp`\n- `Parse(desc_str, keys, error, false)` in `src/wallet/walletutil.cpp`\n- `WalletDescriptor(std::move(desc), 0, 0, 1, 1)` in `src/qt/test/wallettests.cpp`\n- `WalletDescriptor(std::move(desc), creation_time, 0, 0, 0)` in `src/wallet/scriptpubkeyman.cpp`\n- `WalletDescriptor(std::move(desc), 0, 0, 10, 0)` in `src/wallet/test/psbt_wallet_tests.cpp`\n- `WalletDescriptor(std::move(desc), 0, 0, 1, 1)` in `src/wallet/test/wallet_tests.cpp`\n- `WalletDescriptor(std::move(desc), 0, 0, 0, 0)` in `src/wallet/test/util.cpp`\n\n\n\n<sup>2026-10-05 22:33:56</sup>\n",
